---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/config';
const c = site.company;
// Approval flag and date live in src/data/site.yaml (seo.privacyPolicyApproved / privacyPolicyDate).
const APPROVED = site.seo.privacyPolicyApproved;
const APPROVAL_DATE = site.seo.privacyPolicyDate;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Agensi Pekerjaan Final Choice Sdn Bhd"
  description="How Agensi Pekerjaan Final Choice Sdn Bhd collects, uses and protects personal data of employers and domestic helper candidates under Malaysia's PDPA 2010."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' }]}
  noindex={!APPROVED}
>
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" lead={`Last updated: ${APPROVAL_DATE}`} />
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      {!APPROVED && (
        <div class="callout callout--warn" style="margin-bottom:28px">
          <p><strong>Draft for review — not yet approved.</strong> This notice is a starting point prepared under the Personal Data Protection Act 2010 (PDPA), as amended. It is not legal advice. Items marked [CONFIRM] need confirmation by Final Choice management and/or a legal adviser before public launch.</p>
        </div>
      )}
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how {c.legalName} (Company No. {c.registrationNo}) (“Final Choice”, “we”, “us”) collects,
        uses, discloses and protects personal data provided through this website and when you contact us by WhatsApp, telephone
        or email. It is issued in line with the PDPA.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Personal data we collect from employers</h2>
      <p>When you make an enquiry, we may collect your name, contact number, preferred contact method, preferred helper nationality, household requirements and any other information you include in your message.</p>
      <p>Please do not send identity documents, salary slips or other personal documents through the enquiry form or in a first WhatsApp message. If documents are needed for your application, we will tell you how to provide them securely. [CONFIRM: preferred secure method for receiving documents]</p>

      <h2>2. Domestic helper candidate information</h2>
      <p>
        We publish limited biodata of domestic helper candidates only with the candidate’s consent. Published profiles use an agency
        reference code and may include a photograph, nationality, general work experience, skills and languages. We never publish
        passport or identity numbers, personal telephone numbers, home addresses, family details, medical records or immigration documents.
      </p>
      <p>
        A candidate may ask us at any time to correct or remove her published profile. Profiles are removed or updated when a candidate
        is placed, withdraws or is no longer available. To make a request, contact us using the details below. [CONFIRM: consent form wording and retention period]
      </p>

      <h2>3. Obligatory and voluntary information</h2>
      <p>On the enquiry form, your name, contact number and agreement to this policy are obligatory. If you do not provide them, we may not be able to respond. All other fields are voluntary.</p>

      <h2>4. How the enquiry form works</h2>
      <p>
        At present, the enquiry form does not store your details on any server. It opens WhatsApp with your details filled in, and your
        enquiry is only sent when you press Send in WhatsApp. [UPDATE THIS PARAGRAPH if an online form service is connected later]
      </p>

      <h2>5. Why we use personal data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>to respond to your enquiry and recommend suitable domestic helpers;</li>
        <li>to provide the recruitment, placement and renewal services you engage us for;</li>
        <li>to prepare and submit applications to the relevant authorities when you ask us to;</li>
        <li>to keep records of our communications; and</li>
        <li>to comply with applicable laws and regulatory requirements.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will not use your personal data for unrelated marketing without your consent. [CONFIRM: whether marketing messages are sent]</p>

      <h2>6. Who we may disclose it to</h2>
      <p>We do not sell personal data. We may disclose it, only as needed for the purposes above, to relevant Malaysian government agencies and source-country authorities when processing an application you have engaged us for; to service providers that support our operations, such as website hosting (GitHub Pages, operated by GitHub), email (Google) and messaging (WhatsApp, operated by Meta); to professional advisers; and where required or permitted by law. [CONFIRM / ADD: form service, analytics, other providers]</p>

      <h2>7. Transfer outside Malaysia</h2>
      <p>Some service providers may store or process data on servers outside Malaysia. Where this happens, we take reasonable steps to ensure the data receives protection consistent with the PDPA. [LEGAL CHECK: cross-border transfer wording]</p>

      <h2>8. Retention and security</h2>
      <p>We keep personal data only as long as needed for the purposes above or as required by law, and we take reasonable practical steps to protect it from loss, misuse and unauthorised access, including limiting access to staff who need it. [CONFIRM: retention periods and internal security practices]</p>

      <h2>9. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to the PDPA, you may request access to and correction of your personal data, withdraw consent or ask us to limit processing. We may need to verify your identity first. [CONFIRM: whether a fee is charged for access requests]</p>

      <h2>10. Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This website does not currently use advertising or analytics cookies. Fonts are served from this website itself. If we add analytics tools in future, we will update this section.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        {c.legalName}<br />
        Attn: [CONFIRM: name / designation of contact person or Data Protection Officer]<br />
        {c.address.street}, {c.address.postcode} {c.address.city}, Malaysia<br />
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a><br />
        WhatsApp / phone: {site.contact.consultantName} — {site.contact.phoneDisplay}
      </p>
      <p>[LEGAL CHECK: whether a Data Protection Officer must be appointed under the PDPA (Amendment) Act 2024 and related guidelines. A Bahasa Malaysia version should be provided before launch.]</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
